{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "263cb6cf69ee6843bc6f1c1a37e6cb4b8f5bbbd7919350b9d245cf70ad2a2127", "ja": "（環が新しい衣装を試着中だ。新曲に合わせて\n作ってもらったけど、喜んでくれたかな？）", "zh": "（环正在试穿新服装。这是配合新歌定制的，不知道她喜不喜欢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "01ee8981cde471e0ca0492440e2d17f90e901aab28a01275a2962871d3c610a1", "ja": "おやぶん！\nおやぶんおやぶん、おっやぶ～ん♪", "zh": "老大！\n老大老大，老～大♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b17ac1619c842c82736028463e12ee966ad954e7ad269bcbb00148e3d5caaa8e", "ja": "お、おお！？　ビックリした～。", "zh": "哦、哦哦！？吓我一跳～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "b50508fc5d781c565a1c5c1ecb3bcbde585dd01781301a4c45e041c6b62f1b81", "ja": "ねぇねぇおやぶん、どうどう？\nたまき、探検隊の人みたいでしょ！　カッコイイ？", "zh": "呐呐，老大，怎么样怎么样？\n环看起来像探险队员吧！很帅气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5af6537171a9ae23485d06e3dc86fe5ac716c8f811dd5c70c18f083d5ebbd7b4", "ja": "ああ、カッコいいよ。\n環にピッタリだ！", "zh": "嗯，很帅哦。\n非常适合环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "fef66b5e2b7acce9829048f4a03ef672a5bf8ba0869c51d631aea3fb1e40de9a", "ja": "ありがとう！　この服着てると、なんだか宝物が、\nた～～～～っくさん見つけられそうな気がするんだ！", "zh": "谢谢！穿着这身衣服，总觉得好像能找到好多好多宝物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "216856841614ec5f5df41c32fa2f62ba855c33994e0e659e6a7bb8d1b124dc93", "ja": "お仕事いっぱいがんばるから、\nあとでたまきと探検にいこうね！", "zh": "我会努力做好好多工作，所以之后和环一起去探险吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "467934178eb82e90c1006c5eda84d69f4321a14835f7912b8190cfde62669b29", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\nそれじゃ探検の準備をして待ってるよ。", "zh": "啊，好，知道了。\n那我就准备好探险，等着你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "8cb309cbaef74ca09e83091f90831f908ed8bf6238db788e70866924e1bb4be6", "ja": "うん！　たまき、洞窟とか探検したいな～♪\nおっきな石が転がってきたり、落とし穴があるやつ！", "zh": "嗯！环，想去探险洞窟之类的地方呢～♪\n那种会有大石头滚过来，还有陷阱的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cdca7f529fa227105b8c1ca79f374158c0b1dfb3d923ea7824ddbc5030e352b8", "ja": "洞窟に落とし穴……。危ないところは難しいけど。\nアスレチックでいいなら、あとで探しておくよ。", "zh": "洞窟和陷阱啊……危险的地方可就难办了。不过要是找闯关设施的话，我之后帮你找找。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "761ae2196780732112e508d69df19d8e7ca2ee553d33b17ed2e9091cf3cbd82c", "ja": "やったー！　おやぶんがいっしょだと\nいろんな探検ができるから、楽しいぞ～。", "zh": "太好了！有大将一起的话，就能进行各种各样的探险，真开心呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "560eea5fd23526669c97e3a0027c5e9d6a343d7337f90ea6808cae7dec6f975b", "ja": "ははっ、それはよかった。その衣装も、\n環の探検が楽しいって気持ちを取り入れてみたんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。那套服装也融入了环觉得探险很开心的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "8690e30ae877cf4a02af4685591c7534bd43c081f3c0700e2bbd10fc3a6cc9b1", "ja": "そうなんだ～！\nくふふ♪　それなら大成功だね、おやぶん！", "zh": "原来是这样～！\n嘿嘿♪ 那就是大成功啦，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "2f62239961374c1c7eb920a896454fd89f2045440198e0387687ddd860684c7b", "ja": "たまき、ドキドキしたり、ワクワクしたり。\n探検に行きたくて、ウズウズしてるもん！", "zh": "环，心里又紧张又兴奋的。\n因为想去探险，已经按捺不住啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "0bba8b701ac7732593844566caac3ed53fc7c33a1c0cb11604b21afcbaafcbb5", "ja": "そうだー！\nおやぶん、劇場の探検してきてもいい？", "zh": "对了——！\n大叔，我可以去剧场探险吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f63fa83b32f6a9dd7188a426086536c106b5e7fafb612c81950fe75f8ca591ca", "ja": "もちろん、いいよ。\nただし、着替え……。", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n不过，先换好衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "0ee34db6cf45f0bb525c8987fc45db75875a946ba4c802af60fa7d74c25bb7f3", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "那我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "476cdd55e7cf314bf178d6aa51c3e4200db536e4cb68e8c20018ea1a8f89d78d", "ja": "ちょっと待った！", "zh": "等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "21668377c51367408b8e81e42c76e52a197833013b2ce15aba5f0e480cce43cf", "ja": "へっ？　どうしたの、おやぶん？\nもしかして、おやぶんもいっしょに行きたい？", "zh": "咦？怎么了，大哥？\n难道说，大哥也想一起去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c1862a7eb9ca55ff35ca136a93c365adca91e05eca91b919f956cd9e672ba870", "ja": "……そうだな。一緒に探検に行こうかな。\nでもそれは、環が着替えてからにしよう。", "zh": "……也是啊。那我就一起去探险吧。\n不过，还是等环换好衣服之后再去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "f078341c593a0d28314cec36dbe108e9268ea383f670f3cd8909f75920a12cef", "ja": "あ、衣装のこと忘れてた……えへへ。たまき、\nすぐ着替えてくる！　だからおやぶん、待っててね！", "zh": "啊，把服装的事给忘了……嘿嘿。环，\n马上就去换！所以大叔，要等着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3832a81e1010adabae74d526cb49b3d2573b9108def41759a893aa3812d80351", "ja": "ああ。慌てなくていいぞ、環。\nちゃんと待ってるから。", "zh": "嗯，不用着急，环。\n我会好好等着你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "07275417ada32569c3d804ced7a62bca513c6b6d1921a1bc0829ff01aa8ea686", "ja": "はーい！　今日はおやぶんとどこに行こうかな～？", "zh": "好——今天和老大去哪里好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "ae9c7af6f2da15a86fb92c2fb9fd052695defe0153f279e53cb4ef4dcd12b20c", "ja": "あっ！　こぶんと見つけた秘密の場所がいいかも。\nでもおやぶん大きいから、入れるかな～？", "zh": "啊！和小弟一起找到的秘密地点说不定挺好的。\n可是老大个子很大，能进得去吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0374_1024_p", "source_sha256": "57ee2e20d7f71c821621d64ce09c3050c68b2643f0be2d5c5923575a47763456", "ja": "（好奇心は、いつか環自身を助ける武器になるだろう。\nとりあえず、目先の探検に備えておくか……）", "zh": "（好奇心总有一天会成为帮助环的武器吧。总之，先为眼前的探险做好准备吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
